{"h":3395,"lines":[{"x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085,"c":0.5,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.069958845774332645,"t":"1718867188"},{"x":0.10082304061208973,"y":0.097383721316210314,"w":0.33539095560709636,"h":0.018929588219021354,"c":1,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 1"},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.5 score.","c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.65020573933919268,"x":0.10082305614265726,"y":0.13221436958310706},{"t":"The line graph shows trends in shop closures and openings of new shops in a particular country","c":1,"y":0.15694935198927662,"x":0.10082304922364954,"w":0.75102879842122405,"h":0.018922740635237245},{"c":1,"y":0.17545776012755865,"w":0.2595373280843099,"t":"between the years 2011 and 2018.","x":0.1006550856558681,"h":0.018626899404716735},{"t":"In 2011 approximately 6,400 shops closed. The number of closures fluctuated over the next four","c":1,"y":0.19942277974550426,"h":0.021599130439533654,"x":0.10067150499344971,"w":0.74924413045247396},{"t":"years until 2015, when there was a dramatic fall in closures to roughly 700 shops. The following year","h":0.020649747095905613,"y":0.21992276612485107,"x":0.098708128499420414,"c":1,"w":0.78408309936523446},{"y":0.24116607828428827,"c":1,"x":0.098765443308795872,"t":"the number of shops closing their doors rose sharply, reaching over 5,000. The figures remained","w":0.75925923665364592,"h":0.019140164899882239},{"h":0.01750520486011653,"y":0.26017441844314737,"t":"steady for the next two years, with just over 5,000 closures in 2018.","x":0.1008230576985468,"c":1,"w":0.52880655924479159},{"x":0.10082303826704968,"w":0.767489725748698,"h":0.019140164899882239,"t":"The number of new shops opening decreased dramatically between 2011 (approximately 8,500) and","y":0.28621908100806737,"c":1},{"h":0.018972388987546829,"c":1,"t":"2012 (just under 4,000) but rebounded by roughly 50% by 2014. In 2015, the number of openings","x":0.10082306313868382,"w":0.76543207804361979,"y":0.3052325582951888},{"t":"then fell to the 2012 level, but remained stable for the next two years. The last recorded year, 2018,","y":0.32412790736576136,"w":0.77983540852864586,"h":0.018922740635237245,"c":1,"x":0.098765423191567642},{"t":"saw a further fall to 3,000 new openings, the lowest point in this seven year period.","x":0.098765442992148997,"w":0.65020573933919268,"h":0.017441860778592888,"y":0.34447674402631123,"c":1},{"h":0.018936436926097033,"x":0.10082305301884521,"t":"Overall, the number of shop closures has remained within the 5,000 to 7,000 range (with the","y":0.37063953527265969,"c":1,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"h":0.01889534805351778,"y":0.38953488410957338,"t":"exception of 2015). In contrast, new shop openings have shown a wider range of figures, but","c":1,"x":0.10082305490943895,"w":0.71399175008138016},{"c":1,"y":0.40842167234035698,"w":0.46090535481770839,"h":0.018903908656539237,"t":"generally indicate a downward trend over the same period.","x":0.10082304270539372},{"w":0.29423868815104171,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.10082304265213934,"y":0.44316843322440103},{"c":1,"t":"This is a strong response which provides a clear overview in the final paragraph.","h":0.016014052504504717,"w":0.70987655639648439,"y":0.47526501739392479,"x":0.14609052872415645},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.4926383981128799,"x":0.14609052292847555,"t":"Data is presented and key features are highlighted appropriately. Closures are","w":0.68930043538411456},{"x":0.14403291601804388,"w":0.70370371500651041,"y":0.50872093007110586,"h":0.017486372881418633,"t":"dealt with first, and the details are clearly presented, including the [dramatic fal]","c":1},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.14403292327613579,"y":0.5261627905516395,"t":"key feature. Shop openings are dealt with separately, in similar detail. Key peaks"},{"x":0.14403291700700085,"c":1,"y":0.54210836299659582,"t":"and low points are appropriately flagged.","h":0.016031172025610885,"w":0.36419754028320317},{"w":0.72016459147135414,"t":"For the highest task score, there could be more detail provided during the periods","h":0.015996932421752819,"x":0.1440329304973911,"y":0.57558139520282969,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.59156976729470789,"c":1,"x":0.14403293081330504,"t":"of [fluctuation] between 2011 to 2014 and 2016 to 2018.","w":0.4958847554524739},{"y":0.62495077960313805,"w":0.62768229166666667,"c":1,"h":0.017279167759404412,"x":0.14192077889108437,"t":"Ideas are logically organised, taking each line on the graph in turn, and"},{"t":"paragraphing is used appropriately, apart from the single sentence first paragraph.","y":0.64244186033214912,"w":0.72839508056640634,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.14403291230046639,"c":1},{"t":"Cohesion is well managed.","y":0.65842167236601246,"h":0.015996932421752708,"c":1,"x":0.14609053628575225,"w":0.24074073791503908},{"x":0.14397019576803197,"h":0.018780607216770995,"t":"The range of vocabulary is wide, with some skilful use [rebounded by roughly |","y":0.69011008714949262,"w":0.6935372924804688,"c":1},{"t":"further fall | exception of]. The grammar includes a variety of complex structures,","y":0.70629813095083471,"x":0.14396611744956894,"w":0.71208343505859362,"h":0.017566094550142908,"c":1},{"y":0.72379269741761409,"w":0.68724278767903646,"c":1,"h":0.016032883359911265,"t":"with numerous long sentences containing a number of clauses. This is a good","x":0.14403293038887674},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.74116607776089283,"t":"example of a higher-level response to this Task 1 question.","c":1,"x":0.14403290979298783,"w":0.52263376871744804},{"c":1,"t":"137","x":0.84773662590852594,"y":0.86773255798110183,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.013081395583944722}],"w":2400}